<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπράσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντί-ττω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντι-πρήσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>act against, seek to counteract,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				264
			</span></i> (
				Med.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1320a6
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>act in opposition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				32.14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀντιπρήσσων,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιστασιώτης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.92
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι</span>
			<i>oppose</i> in any way, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				2.3.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐάν τε ἀντιπράττῃ τις ἐάν τε μὴ
					συμπράττῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1379a13
				</span></i>
			; <i>conflict with, tell against</i> a theory, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1055.20
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				2.17
			</span></i>.</div>
